notice-paired = { $name } confirmed the pairing.
notice-rules = Rules of { $name } for your requests: { $rules }
notice-request = { $name } asks for a sign of life.
notice-response = { $name }: { $response }
notice-reported = Answered { $name } automatically: { $reason }. The request stays open until you respond.
notice-ended = { $name } has ended the connection.
notice-rejected = { $name } rejected the pairing, probably because the check code did not match. Trying again needs a new invitation.
